00:07:15.486 --> 00:07:16.340
Say hi.

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:17.422
- [Kelly] Hi!

00:07:17.422 --> 00:07:18.621
- Say hello.

00:07:18.621 --> 00:07:20.241
- Hi!
- Hi!

00:07:20.241 --> 00:07:22.574
Oh my gosh, you're adorable.

00:07:23.667 --> 00:07:26.675
(laughs loudly)

00:07:26.675 --> 00:07:28.528
- You wanna say hi too, come on, come on.

00:07:28.528 --> 00:07:29.928
Come on say hi.
- Hi.

00:07:29.928 --> 00:07:33.112
- Hi, oh my gosh, you have
a beautiful smile too.

00:07:33.112 --> 00:07:34.286
Hello?

00:07:34.286 --> 00:07:35.333
- Hi.

00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:36.231
- Hi.

00:07:36.231 --> 00:07:39.308
- All right, I'll be with
you in a second, okay?

00:07:39.308 --> 00:07:41.062
- That happens with me all
the time too, you're good.

00:07:41.062 --> 00:07:42.186
(laughs)

00:07:42.186 --> 00:07:44.187
- Right, so, what I'm saying is,

00:07:44.187 --> 00:07:46.307
I think we might've been ahead of our time

00:07:46.307 --> 00:07:49.414
because the qualifier rounds,

00:07:49.414 --> 00:07:50.247
now that had to walk in

00:07:50.247 --> 00:07:53.376
and it's literally just us and just them.

00:07:53.376 --> 00:07:55.655
There's no audience, there's no lights,

00:07:55.655 --> 00:07:57.163
and all of that.
- It's very quarantinish.

00:07:57.163 --> 00:07:57.996
- Yeah, yeah.

00:07:57.996 --> 00:08:01.075
But like before we even knew,
like were social distancing

00:08:01.075 --> 00:08:02.873
before we knew that we
needed social distance,

00:08:02.873 --> 00:08:05.067
like it's kind of a cool thing.

00:08:05.067 --> 00:08:09.731
- But like okay, so speaking
of dances and dance craze,

00:08:09.731 --> 00:08:12.731
I remember, I mean,
I'm not a great dancer.

00:08:12.731 --> 00:08:15.674
I'm like that girl that can
like dance remotely okay.

00:08:15.674 --> 00:08:18.030
Like you know I'm in a club, so it's like,

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.331
but there's always been a dance craze.

00:08:20.331 --> 00:08:22.248
Like I mean, I just, you know,

00:08:22.248 --> 00:08:25.057
the moonwalk or dabbing
or even the Roger Rabbit,

00:08:25.057 --> 00:08:25.890
that had its moment.

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:26.723
- Yeah!

00:08:26.723 --> 00:08:27.556
(laughs)

00:08:27.556 --> 00:08:29.798
- Like everything has its moment.

00:08:29.798 --> 00:08:32.377
But so the name always seems random,

00:08:32.377 --> 00:08:34.110
you know, of whatever dance craze it is.

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:37.167
So when your friend Derek Hough was here,

00:08:37.167 --> 00:08:40.019
we asked him if he
could create some dances

00:08:40.019 --> 00:08:42.135
