00:08:43.125 --> 00:08:46.478
- I am gonna call out random
things to make up a dance.

00:08:46.478 --> 00:08:47.311
- Okay.

00:08:47.311 --> 00:08:48.496
- Yeah, no pressure don't suck.

00:08:48.496 --> 00:08:49.329
everyone's watching.

00:08:49.329 --> 00:08:50.441
(audience laughing)

00:08:50.441 --> 00:08:51.843
Okay, the plunger.

00:08:51.843 --> 00:08:54.426
(upbeat music)
(audience laughing)

00:08:57.959 --> 00:09:00.650
Okay, how about the Rumba?

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:03.844
