The Griffin Door.

00:09:06.728 --> 00:09:08.219
(audience cheering)

00:09:08.219 --> 00:09:09.052
- Wow!

00:09:09.052 --> 00:09:09.885
(laughs loudly)

00:09:13.792 --> 00:09:15.223
- That's the drill, that's the drill.

00:09:15.223 --> 00:09:17.265
- That's a C grade.

00:09:17.265 --> 00:09:19.787
All right, so we just
showed the tape of Derek,

00:09:19.787 --> 00:09:21.767
obviously killing it in the video.

00:09:21.767 --> 00:09:22.600
He did really well.

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:23.433
- Yeah, right.

00:09:23.433 --> 00:09:25.823
- So I just feel like Ne-Yo,

00:09:25.823 --> 00:09:29.564
you might be able to
one-up him one, and also

00:09:29.564 --> 00:09:31.815
I feel like I kinda like
to participate this time

00:09:31.815 --> 00:09:33.007
'cause I'm super competitive.

00:09:33.007 --> 00:09:34.149
So I was just asking.
- Wait a minute,

00:09:34.149 --> 00:09:35.850
are you challenging me,

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:37.830
to a dance-off right now?
- I am dance challenging you.

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:40.639
The next time that you are in my studio,

00:09:40.639 --> 00:09:42.608
we can be around each other.

00:09:42.608 --> 00:09:45.742
I'll even be six feet
apart from you, fine.

00:09:45.742 --> 00:09:48.176
But I'm challenging you to the same game.

00:09:48.176 --> 00:09:50.098
My producer, I don't know the words,

00:09:50.098 --> 00:09:52.124
they'll call out a name and something

00:09:52.124 --> 00:09:53.077
and we have to do it.

00:09:53.077 --> 00:09:53.910
And I'm challenging you,

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.685
and I think that I will whip your behind,

00:09:55.685 --> 00:09:57.178
